  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, a bumbler gains a luck bonus on a single d20 roll each round. This is their “lucky roll”. The value of this bonus is equal to twice the number of critical failures they had on their last turn. The bumbler must declare they are using their lucky roll before they roll, and if the roll fails the use is still expended, but not if the roll is a critical failure.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bumbler#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
